Total Changes: 40

[CLN] (*_,)sale(,_*): rename `expense_policy` field to `reinvoice_policy`

Rename the `expense_policy` field on `product.template` to `reinvoice_policy`.
The field was originally introduced for expense-related use cases, but its scope
has since expanded and is no longer specific to expenses.

follow up of task-5490517

